<p>seasonal.job is a filmmaker's brand. The camera work comes first: gigs, events and the people in them, posted on <a href="<?= e(config('instagram_url')) ?>" rel="noopener">Instagram @seasonal.job</a>.</p>
<p>LITHUSA was the first shirt. It was made for a single fair, for everyone who lives between Lithuania and the USA, and sold there by hand.</p>
<p>What's left from that run is sold here as the First Edition: 33 tees and 31 hats with their original tags and packaging. Each comes with a card carrying its number. When they're gone, they're gone.</p>
<p>LITHUSA comes back later as Edition 02, printed to order and shipped to the US and Europe, next to new designs. <a href="#signup-email">Join the list</a> to hear first.</p>
